  "releaseNotes": "## 0.5.6\n\n### Changed\n\n* Reworked Windows precision delays to use safe wait handles, respond directly to cancellation, and fall back when high-resolution waitable timers are unavailable.\n\n### Fixed\n\n* Synchronized concurrent registration and lookup in `CanRegistry`, with stable snapshots for endpoint enumeration and factory error reporting.\n\n### Breaking Changes\n\n* None.",
